# Scenario 'monkey_2': seeded pseudo-random button mashing (seed 2) on the fully set-up cartridge
# (state left by 'tutorial_profile', fake Internet + synthetic web). Deterministic: the PRNG is inside the harness and the
# resolved presses are recorded in monkey_2.txt. Purpose: broad coverage of code the guided scenarios do not reach.
# Absence of coverage after this proves nothing; presence is evidence of executed code.
wait 400                     # boot
waitstable 60 max 600
shot start
monkey 24000 2 20        # 24000 frames, a random tap every 4+20 frames
shot end
